Subject: Adverse Cyber News Alert: Third-Party Exposure Affecting L’Oréal SA and Renault SA – April 2026

The following executive summary assesses the digital risk to bank clients identified during routine portfolio monitoring.

*   **Incident Summary:** An unprotected Elasticsearch cluster at French email provider Alinto exposed 40 million SMTP records on April 9, 2026, leaking email addresses and traffic metadata for bank clients **L’Oréal SA** and **Renault SA**. 
*   **Operational Risk:** Exfiltrated metadata enables mapping of internal communication patterns, significantly escalating the risk of targeted spear-phishing and Business Email Compromise (BEC) campaigns against client executive and engineering staff. 
